in just a few weeks here.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:22.960
And effectively
what we're doing is

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.560
we're making our SD-WAN
appliance, the virtual instance

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:29.990
of it, available on
the GCP marketplace.

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:32.020
And so with this
customers will be

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:35.150
able to effectively download,
check out, if you will,

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:40.540
and then spin up within a VPC,
a Citrix SD-WAN appliance.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:44.380
And so with that configuration,
branches, data centers,

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:49.330
