connection via cable or DSL,

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:26.530
they can use 4G LTE as a backup.

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:30.093
And because this failover
occurs in less than seconds,

00:08:30.093 --> 00:08:31.510
really, for the
most part, there's

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:36.360
