vectors are expanding.

00:09:56.050 --> 00:10:02.170
And so we have built-in security
controls within our appliances.

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:06.220
We have, essentially, stateful
application firewalls.

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:09.230
We have options via
partnerships to actually bring

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:11.920
